> **SELF-EXCLUSION NOTE:** This file is saved with the `.md.excluded` extension in compliance with `RULES.md` and `tasks/research.md`. The route for `frantic-ferret-free` existed on OpenCode's production endpoints for approximately two hours on November 8, 2026 before being withdrawn via PR #62780. No independent testing harness (Artificial Analysis, LMArena, StealthMark, etc.) published verified, reproducible capability rows during this ephemeral window. In accordance with project policy against fabricating scores or importing lineage proxies, no numerical scores are asserted.

## Model card

- **Name:** Frantic Ferret
- **Short description:** Ephemeral stealth preview model deployed briefly on OpenCode Console on November 8, 2026 and withdrawn the same evening; listed under Responses API before deprecation.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Responses API (`https://opencode.ai/inference/openai/v1/responses`); catalog ID `opencode/frantic-ferret-free`. Route is no longer available.
- **Release / knowledge:** Listed November 8, 2026 (~18:51 UTC) and withdrawn (~21:02 UTC).
- **IDs:** `opencode/frantic-ferret-free`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens input, with 270,000 maximum output tokens.
- **Modalities:** Multimodal (text, image, video in; text out); supported six-level reasoning effort parameter (`minimal` to `max`).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-08):** Free ($0.00 / 1M tokens) during its brief test listing.
- **Architecture:** Unannounced frontier multimodal transformer with native extended reasoning.

